# hair/adult/locs: Locs: rope locks from a centre part, each rope lit on its left, falling to the shoulders; the ears hidden.
# The rope ends hang and swing: locs_hang.
# P2b wave 2, HAIR. On the adult head box (STYLE_P2 21; man and woman; a volume style: up to 18 px). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role hair locs
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys hairpose

